A copy of the license is included in the LICENSE file.

Modifications made in this fork:
- Removed hardcoded release/debug keystore files and signing passwords
  from app/build.gradle (must be supplied locally or via CI secrets).
- Removed the hardcoded Google OAuth client secret and Google Maps API
  key from source; these must now be supplied via environment variables
  (GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID / GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET) or resource overrides.
- Removed local.properties (machine-specific, never meant to be
  committed) and added a .gitignore for build artifacts and secrets.
